Please review this PR before I merge it.

Project: Agent Archive — Next.js 16 App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind, static export (`output: "export"`) to GitHub Pages. Pages live in src/app/[locale]/ and get `locale` ("en" | "ko") from params. UI strings live in src/i18n/dictionaries.ts and every key must exist in both en and ko.

Requirement (PR #19): "Status and difficulty badges, the agent and workflow cards, and the agents search panel still rendered English on /ko. Translate badges, cards, and the agent search panel into Korean." The PR moves strings into new `agentMeta` and `agentSearch` dictionary groups, passes locale to the badges, types badge props as VerifiedStatus / Difficulty, and removes the unused `formatStatus` helper from src/lib/utils.ts.

Test output: `npm run check:data` passed, `npm run lint` passed, `npm run typecheck` passed, `npm test` — 20 tests pass, `npm run build` passed.

Known constraints: no server-side searchParams; client components only read the URL via useSearchParams. Role and category chips intentionally still use titleCase(slug) in this PR (taxonomy translation is a separate issue).

The full PR touches 9 files (+165/-52): the two pages that render badges, agent-card.tsx, agent-detail-header.tsx, agent-search-panel.tsx, badge.tsx, workflow-card.tsx, dictionaries.ts, utils.ts. Here is the diff for the two files I'm least sure about:

